<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n38092" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praetermissĭo</span></b> ,
		ōnis, f.
		praetermitto. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A leaving out</i>, <i>omission</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sine ullius formae praetermissione,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Top. 7, 31</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A passing over</i>, <i>neglecting</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praetermissio aedilitatis,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Cic.
					Off. 2, 17, 58</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
